      { q: 'Is this a HIPAA compliant medical answering service?', a: "Sara doesn't store or read medical records or clinical information. She works on the conversation and the calendar: who called, what they asked for and when they're booked. We don't advertise HIPAA compliance; if your practice needs a BAA or has specific requirements, we go through them with you in the demo before anything goes live." },
      { q: 'Do I keep my phone number?', a: 'Yes. Sara answers on your current number. During onboarding we connect the line so the calls the front desk can\'t take go to Sara: after hours, on overflow, or all of them, whichever you prefer. Patients never see a new number.' },
      { q: 'What happens after hours and on weekends?', a: 'Sara answers exactly the same way. She books into your Google Calendar on real availability, texts the deposit link and leaves the summary in your dashboard, so Monday starts with appointments instead of a list of messages to return.' },
